   "text": "Equations of motion from (6.2) are given by ˙¯h(t) = −∂h ˙θ(t) = ∂h ∂θ = π2ρ(θ)ρ′(θ), ∂¯h = ¯h(t) (6.6) Substituting the boundary relations (6.3) in these equations, one ﬁnds (6.7).",
